## 12. What this proof does not cover

- The bootstrap phase (stages 0 and 1 use circulating-supply-based advancement; the proof applies from stage 2 onward in the standard-tranche model)
- The 30-stage hard cap of the current implementation (convergence is asymptotic; the worst-case claim holds at every stage)
- Market price beyond the protocol sell price (secondary markets)
- Paths where stage completion does not occur

